  "docs": {
    "description": "Single row inside a Context Menu. 8 variants: state (default, hover, focus, disabled) × destructive (false, true). destructive=true is for irreversible actions like Delete and uses the danger text colour; its disabled row uses the disabled ink, which wins over danger. The trailing shortcut is plain text in text/tertiary, not a Kbd. Optional leading icon. Submenus are not supported — keep to a single nesting level.",
